% expect-output: /syntaxerror
% Scenario: a binary-encoding lead byte (128-159) is a distinct scan error
% rather than a crash; the program sees syntaxerror.
% Expect: prints "/syntaxerror".
{ (\200) cvx exec } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==
